    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Dexterity or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Magical Resilience.</strong> You have Resistance to one of the following damage types, chosen when you gain this feat: Necrotic, Psychic, Radiant, or Thunder.</p><p><strong>Magic Resistant.</strong> When you would fail a saving throw against a spell or a magical effect, you can roll 1d6 and add the number rolled to the total, which can turn the failure into a success. You can use this benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
